diff --git a/.garura/project/issues/798/context/shape-slice/intent-issue.json b/.garura/project/issues/798/context/shape-slice/intent-issue.json
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.garura/project/issues/798/context/shape-slice/intent-issue.json
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+{
+  "verb": "view-issue",
+  "platform": "github",
+  "commands": [
+    [
+      "gh",
+      "issue",
+      "view",
+      "788",
+      "--json",
+      "number,title,labels,state,body,url,closedAt,issueType,parent,subIssues,subIssuesSummary"
+    ]
+  ],
+  "stdout": "{\"body\":\"**Hypothesis:** We believe a person can name a piece of work and leave its design to agents. Agents shape the work into a slice a person can test, plan it, and write its eval. The person approves that design once. We believe this makes the work faster and keeps it inside its design. The person no longer guides each step by hand.\\n\\n**We will know it is true when** a business intent goes from its issue to an approved design:\\n- a slice that one person can test end to end on one surface, with the features it needs in build order;\\n- a plan that can be run and tracked: the plan file, one epic for the slice, and one story per feature;\\n- an eval that tests, from the outside, whether the business intent is met;\\n- with one person approval, at the end;\\n- with every step run by a play, and no step done by hand;\\n- with the eval kept where no builder can read it.\\n\\n**Rules**\\n1. **The shaping loop (ADR 049).** Three plays, in this order:\\n   - `/shape-slice` reads the model and memory first, asks the person only what neither answers (all at once, within the question limit), and writes the slice into the product model;\\n   - the plan play (#818) makes the plan file, the epic and one story per feature;\\n   - the eval play (#798) writes the eval in the plan's evals folder, which no builder reads.\\n2. **One approval (#796).** The person approves the slice, the plan and the eval together, before anything goes to the tracker.\\n3. **The plan is the work list (ADR 051).** There is no `/next`. The plan names what comes next.\\n4. **Gate:** the ready check (#760). No shaping on an ICE that is not ready.\\n\\n**Plays in scope:** `/shape-slice`, the plan play, the eval play, and the one approval step.\\n\\n**Out of scope:**\\n- Design, build, test and validation of an epic: business intent #819.\\n- Release (`/release-feature`, `/release-increment`) and `/learn-outcomes`.\\n- Upgrading an older product model: business intent #835.\\n\\n**Comes first (done):** the ontology decides what the chain works on (v8 to v10: #793, #816, #826; ADR 048, ADR 049).\\n\\n**Identified by:** #756. While starting #760, the product owner asked which play designs the work, and found none for Garura's own work.\\n\\n**Plan:** `.garura/project/plans/788.yaml`, on the branch `plan/788/base`. It lands back into `plan/756/base`.\\n\\nRecorded with the product owner, 2026-10-22. Rewritten 2026-10-24 to the shaping loop as decided on 2026-10-23 (ADR 049, ADR 051; the build stage moved to #819).\\n\",\"closedAt\":null,\"issueType\":null,\"labels\":[],\"number\":788,\"parent\":null,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"subIssues\":{\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZJw60A\",\"number\":792,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"The delivery chain works on Work, not on epics and slices\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/792\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZJxCqw\",\"number\":794,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"The shaping loop turns a business intent into a testable slice, its plan and its eval\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/794\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZXih6Q\",\"number\":833,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"Remove the remaining deprecated skills and agents, and stop the public installer shipping them\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/833\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZcHBjQ\",\"number\":842,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"/shape-slice: show the reuse and warning results at the checkpoint, and close three small gaps\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/842\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZiqltQ\",\"number\":844,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[TASK] shape-slice: shape the slice for business intent #788\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/844\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZlWcOw\",\"number\":846,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[TASK] edit-ontology: /shape-slice writes the slice's hidden file and proposes a thin ICE (ontology v11)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/846\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZoWmoA\",\"number\":855,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[TASK] Mark the twelve old-chain plays and their skills stale, and keep stale parts out of every install\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/855\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZcFg5Q\",\"number\":841,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[BUG] check-change reviews only the first 100 files of a pull request\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/841\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZp3sJw\",\"number\":860,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[BUG] Installed parts (plays, agents, skills) read Garura's source tree (core/components, core/tools) at run time, so they break after an install (P1)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/860\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZqBSgw\",\"number\":861,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[TASK] Chore: the three P3 findings left by the PR #858 review, round 2\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/861\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZujQuw\",\"number\":865,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[TASK] Chore: the three small findings left by the PR #864 review, round 4\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/865\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZuo0xQ\",\"number\":866,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[TASK] shape-slice: shape the slice for business intent #788\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/866\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZurjcA\",\"number\":867,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[BUG] The agents' copy script refuses reads from short-term and Garura memory (no version)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/867\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZurj_g\",\"number\":868,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[BUG] The current ontology and other current standards are in no memory tier\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/868\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZu3ipQ\",\"number\":870,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[TASK] check-change has no review playbook for product model pages or run records\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/870\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZvCp3Q\",\"number\":872,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[TASK] Chore: the two small findings left by the PR #871 review\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/872\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZvl6nQ\",\"number\":874,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[TASK] Chore: the findings left by the PR #873 review (the plan play)\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/874\"},{\"id\":\"I_kwDORA56Ic8AAAABZwDAnA\",\"number\":878,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[TASK] shape-plan: make the plan for business intent #788\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/878\"}],\"totalCount\":18},\"subIssuesSummary\":{\"completed\":11,\"percentCompleted\":61,\"total\":18},\"title\":\"When a work is identified, agents should be able to design it and then run the implementation via plays and loop\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/intent-driven-ai/garura/issues/788\"}\n",
