ery-planning/shape-slice/capability.md) (capability) \u2014 adds\n- [shape-eval](../software-delivery-planning/shape-eval/capability.md) (capability) \u2014 adds\n- [cap-718](../software-delivery-planning/cap-718/capability.md) (capability) \u2014 changes\n- fn-727 and fn-728 (features of cap-718, from bi-717) \u2014 moved under cap-718's folder; fn-727's text unchanged\n- [fn-728](../software-delivery-planning/cap-718/fn-728/feature.md) (feature) \u2014 changes: the epic and the stories get tracker issues, not every node\n\n**What was done:** (nothing yet)\n",
