ry-planning/shape-slice/capability.md) (capability) \u2014 adds\n- [shape-eval](../software-delivery-planning/shape-eval/capability.md) (capability) \u2014 adds\n- [cap-718](../software-delivery-planning/cap-718/capability.md) (capability) \u2014 changes\n\n**What was done:** (nothing yet)\n"
